    "title": "Coffee Rush On Route 34 As 7 Brew Targets Kendall Marketplace Corner - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jo Marquez ,\n5 hours ago Yorkville officials say a new 7 Brew Coffee drive-thru is on deck for Kendall Marketplace, with construction expected to kick off this summer and a grand opening targeted for late 2026. The compact stand would sit near the main signalized entrance to the shopping center, giving morning commuters another quick-service stop as development along Route 34 keeps picking up steam. Read full article",
